    "On the Mac, open AskHuman Settings → Experimental → iOS app channel and choose “Pair a new phone”. It shows a QR code and a pairing code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上打开 AskHuman 设置 → 实验 → iOS App 渠道，点“配对新手机”，会显示二维码和配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Mac, open AskHuman Settings → Experimental → iOS app channel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上打开 AskHuman 设置 → 实验 → iOS App 渠道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the old request-based plan, Max is billed at API rates. It starts off for each new task, and your Mac keeps Max off unless you allow it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旧的按次计费套餐里，Max 按 API 价格计费。每次新建任务时默认关闭；不允许时，Mac 会让 Max 保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once it is on, an Agent's questions get an automatic reply: you are away, so it should go on by its own judgement. Only when it cannot go on does it ask you again, and then your phone and Mac let you know." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，Agent 的提问会自动得到回复：你不在，请按它自己的判断继续。只有它确实无法继续时才会再次向你提问，那时你的手机和 Mac 会提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
